5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I believe we should examine the staffing situation before committing to new plans. I'll look into the roster books and the crew establishment.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We always forget the past! I'm checking the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to see what the actual constraints are. I will look into the joint operators' committee minutes and the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I'm worried about the long-term costs. I think I'll check the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I want to know where the time actually goes! I'll pick the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city, and the journey audits!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
